<title>FRANCE: Rhone-Poulenc finalises seeds sale.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc finalises seeds sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rhone-Poulenc  SA said its Clause SA unit had finalised the sale of its Clause Semences, Clause Jardin and Harris Moran Seed Co to the Vilmorin and Co unit of Limagrain. It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>The transaction took effect on October 1.</p>
<p>Rhone also confirmed its intention to launch a mandatory redemption offer by the end of this year for all shares held by Clause SA minority shareholders.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
